<%- include('../../partials/site-top', { title: 'Accessibility Statement' }) %>
<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6">
  <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold">Accessibility Statement</h1>
  <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-navy-700">

    <p><%= brand.name %> is committed to making this website usable by everyone, including people using screen readers, keyboard navigation, and assistive technology.</p>
    <p>Our accessibility practices include: large readable text, strong color contrast, descriptive headings and labels, keyboard-accessible navigation, a skip-to-content link, and forms with clear error messages.</p>
    <p>We aim to meet WCAG 2.1 Level AA. If you have difficulty using any part of this site — or would prefer information by phone, mail, or large print — please contact us and we will gladly accommodate you.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<%- include('../../partials/site-bottom') %>
